# Everything a run against a live tenant leaves here. `secrets/` holds a
# delegated admin token and the generated user passwords; `config.json` holds
# the real tenant id and its domain; `directory.json` holds the object ids
# `setup_directory.py` made. CLAUDE.md forbids committing any of them.
#
# Ignored rather than merely untracked, because `prepare-ci-tree.py` stages a
# tier from `git ls-files --cached --others --exclude-standard`. An untracked
# file that no rule excludes is copied into `.local-tmp/ci-*-tree` by the next
# `make test-stack` or `make test-authentik`.
config.json
directory.json
secrets/
